저한세(소득기본세, IBT)를 계산해, 일부 공제·면세 항목과 해외 소득(100만 대만달러 이상일 때)을 더한 기본소득에서 750만 대만달러를 뺀 금액의 20%가 일반 소득세보다 많으면 그 차액을 냅니다. 대만에 90일 넘게 183일 미만 머문 비거주 외국인의 급여는 18% 단일세율입니다.","note_en":"PwC describes this as the resident progressive schedule ‘for 2025 IIT return filing’ and does not state which income year it covers. Residents must also compute the income basic tax (IBT), an alternative minimum tax: if 20% of basic income — regular taxable income plus certain add-backs and foreign-sourced income of 1 million Taiwan dollars or more — minus 7.5 million Taiwan dollars exceeds the regular tax, they pay the difference. Non-resident foreigners staying more than 90 but fewer than 183 days pay a flat 18% on salary.","src":[["PwC Worldwide Tax Summaries","Taiwan — Taxes on personal income (대만 개인소득세), 2026-08-20 검토","https://taxsummaries.pwc.com/taiwan/individual/taxes-on-personal-income","research"]]}}}